(b) to distribute: con acus. de cosa and dat. of person(s), Mc.6:41; as in later usage (cf. Polyb., xi, 28, 9), to bestow: Ro.12:3, 1Co.7:17, 2Co.10:13, Heb.7:2; med., con acus. de cosa before μετά, Lc.12:13 (cf. δια-, συμ-μερίζω).†
(AS)

he.fuller:
μερίζω
(μέρος), [בשבעים בעיקר for חָלַק ;]
